@startuml F4.2d-atribuicao-lote
title F4.2d — Atribuição em lote (só Atribuir)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "COEController" as Ctrl
participant "AssignInternshipUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Atribuir selecionados
note right of WebApp
  BulkActionBar sem
  "Aprovar" (RN-F4.2-07)
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/coe/assign\n{ internshipIds[] }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE N\n+ outbox por estágio
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: N linhas atualizadas

@enduml
